Clinical Course: The kidneys will likely produce massive amounts of urine over the next 48 hours as they flush out the built-up toxins. The nausea will gradually subside.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

If you feel extremely dizzy or faint, or if you become confused, your body may be losing fluid too rapidly through the catheter. You must seek emergency medical care immediately.

